ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLing finds that her niece, Xiao Fang, is obsessed with mobile games, which affects her studies. Xiao Fang says the phone is for keeping in touch with friends.\n\n[Question]\nHow does Ling convince Xiao Fang?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Ling proposes a no-phone day every week, letting Xiao Fang experience life without a phone.\nB. Ling can watch some documentaries or articles about phone addiction and screen time management with Xiao Fang.\nC. Ling suggests that Xiao Fang does a period of no-screen activity before bed every night, such as reading paper books, to help her sleep better.\nD. Ling encourages Xiao Fang to participate in school or community team activities, so she can interact with friends in real life, not just in the virtual world.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002182647969837294,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e0e2d6006945d27fd802","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367714445,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:28:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"5f66fcb6cbb943c2a9a63b20d638fb8f"}